      "content": "I'm not familiar with Valgrind for this specific embedded target, so I'll have to check if we can run it in our simulation environment. Regarding the manual inspection, the snippet I sent clearly shows a `new[]` without a `delete[]`. Why do you think that's such a persistent issue in these types of systems?",
